      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\r\n             **HOW TO PLAY**\r\n\r\nUse Arrow Keys or W, A, S, D to
    move the snake.\r\n\r\nCollect food to grow and increase your score.\r\n\r\n             
    **FOOD GUIDE**\r\n\r\n**RED FOOD \u2013 NORMAL**\r\n\r\nGrow by 1 segment and
    earn 1 point.\r\n\r\n**YELLOW FOOD \u2013 BONUS**\r\n\r\nEarn bonus points with
    a 5-second score multiplier.\r\n\r\n**CYAN FOOD \u2013 SHRINK**\r\n\r\nRemove
    2 segments. Minimum snake length is 3.\r\n\r\n                    **RULES**\r\n\r\nAvoid
    hitting the walls and your own body.\r\n\r\nCollect as much food as possible
    and beat your high score!\r\n"
